# Derived by hand from Semantics ch. 8 (a blueprint value is built at the applying block's next positions; `<-` binds the child's result) and ch. 9 (under a tag's arm a blueprint answers with the tag's output): the answering widget's label is 0, the arm's own label 1, the last label 2. Never run to the end: the build faults.
test a_blueprint_of_a_tag_arm_applied

tick 0
  added:
    0: Ui.Label(text="answering a")
    1: Ui.Label(text="heard yes a")
    2: Ui.Label(text="end")
